#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:4
msgid "Unit тестирование BPMN процессов"
msgstr "Unit Testing of BPMN Processes"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:7
msgid "1. Тестирование реализаций бизнес процессов BPMN"
msgstr "1. Testing BPMN Business Process Implementations"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:9
msgid ""
"С добавлением camunda как движка BPMN, в проекте появилась возможность "
"писать unit тесты для процессов."
msgstr ""
"With the addition of Camunda as the BPMN engine, the project now supports "
"writing unit tests for processes."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:11
msgid ""
"На текущий момент, есть возможность писать тесты только в микросервисе "
"ecos-process, в дальнейшем планируется добавить возможность написания "
"тестов для различных проектов."
msgstr ""
"Currently, tests can only be written within the ecos-process microservice; "
"support for writing tests in other projects is planned for the future."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:13
msgid ""
"Для написания unit тестов используются библиотеки облегчающие "
"тестирование bpmn:"
msgstr ""
"The following libraries are used to simplify BPMN unit testing:"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:15
msgid ""
"https://github.com/camunda-community-hub/camunda-platform-scenario - "
"написание unit тестов по стилю `GivenWhenThen "
"<https://martinfowler.com/bliki/GivenWhenThen.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"https://github.com/camunda-community-hub/camunda-platform-scenario - "
"writing unit tests in the `GivenWhenThen "
"<https://martinfowler.com/bliki/GivenWhenThen.html>`_ style"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:16
msgid ""
"https://github.com/camunda/camunda-bpm-platform/tree/master/test-"
"utils/assert - удобные bpmn ассерты для тестов"
msgstr ""
"https://github.com/camunda/camunda-bpm-platform/tree/master/test-"
"utils/assert - convenient BPMN assertions for tests"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:19
msgid "2. Тестирование Citeck компонентов BPMN"
msgstr "2. Testing Citeck BPMN Components"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:21
msgid ""
"Тесты написанные для проверки Citeck компонентов bpmn представляют собой "
"небольшие процессы BPMN, которые реализуют варианты использования Citeck "
"компонентов, с дальнейшем запуском процесса и проверкой результатов."
msgstr ""
"Tests written to verify Citeck BPMN components consist of small BPMN "
"processes that implement use cases for Citeck components, followed by "
"running the process and verifying the results."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:23
msgid ""
"Тесты располагаются в микросервисе ecos-process по пути "
"``src/test/java/ru/citeck/ecos/process/domain/bpmn/elements`` и написаны "
"в стиле `GivenWhenThen "
"<https://martinfowler.com/bliki/GivenWhenThen.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"The tests are located in the ecos-process microservice at "
"``src/test/java/ru/citeck/ecos/process/domain/bpmn/elements`` and are "
"written in the `GivenWhenThen "
"<https://martinfowler.com/bliki/GivenWhenThen.html>`_ style."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:25
msgid ""
"Предполагается покрытие тестами каждого компонента. На момент написания "
"статьи написано порядка 40 тестов."
msgstr ""
"Every component is expected to be covered by tests. At the time of writing, "
"approximately 40 tests have been written."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:28
msgid "2.1 Пример unit BPMN теста"
msgstr "2.1 BPMN Unit Test Example"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:30
msgid "Проверка назначения userTask по роли."
msgstr "Verifying userTask assignment by role."

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:32
msgid "Процесс:"
msgstr "Process:"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:38
msgid "Unit test:"
msgstr "Unit test:"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:40
msgid "Bpmn unit test"
msgstr "BPMN unit test"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/process/process_bpmn/process_bpmn_unit_tests.rst:62
msgid ""
"Таким образом, проверяется, что при выполнении компонента **userTask**, "
"была назначена задача на корректных пользователей и группы исходя из "
"указанных ролей."
msgstr ""
"This verifies that when the **userTask** component is executed, the task "
"is assigned to the correct users and groups based on the specified roles."
